---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Residence Lawyer in Barcelona | Spain Immigration" description="Residence lawyer in Barcelona helping international clients with Spanish residence permits, renewals, modifications and immigration routes.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Residency" title="Spain residence lawyer: which permit or route fits your situation?" description="The answer depends on where you are, your current status, your family circumstances and the legal route available to you." primaryLabel="Discuss my situation" primaryHref="/en/contact" secondaryLabel="Immigration services" secondaryHref="/en/immigration" />
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Before collecting documents</span><h2>Identify the route first. Then build the file around it.</h2></div><div class="prose"><ul><li>Are you already in Spain or applying from abroad?</li><li>Do you hold or previously hold a residence authorisation?</li><li>Are you seeking a first permit, renewal, modification or another route?</li><li>Do work or professional circumstances affect the application?</li><li>Do family links affect the route?</li><li>Are there current notifications or deadlines?</li></ul><p>Preparing documents before the route is clear can create unnecessary work. A first review should identify the procedure and the evidence that matters.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container cards"><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Status</span><h3>Current immigration history</h3><p>Existing permits, applications and previous decisions can change which route is available.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Evidence</span><h3>Supporting documents</h3><p>The required evidence depends on the route and your personal circumstances.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Timing</span><h3>Notifications and expiry dates</h3><p>Put any deadline or official notification at the top of the first message.</p></div></div></div></section>
<CTA title="Need help identifying the right residence route?" text="Tell us where you are, your current immigration status and what you are trying to achieve." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
